{"unit_id":"nico-zhuang__dsh-nav-fold#card-zh","repo":"nico-zhuang/dsh-nav-fold","commit":"35f94bec830f4a3ebe47d19583715fb59d67cdd6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-nav-fold 是面向 DSH Web 侧栏的导航整理插件。它在全局面板底部添加折叠控件，把面板收成可换行的图标网格，并支持拖动或 Alt 加方向键排序，顺序保存在本机。可选启用工作区、活动会话和收藏会话三栏；活动列表按待处理、运行、未读和最近会话整理，收藏沿用 DSH 置顶数据，并提供打开、置顶、归档和复制会话 ID 等操作。启用三栏后还可用自定义快捷键进入键盘焦点导航。另有独立的 macOS 顶部 Logo 隐藏设置。三栏默认关闭，不需额外 API key；未知宿主侧栏结构下会回退到原生工作区。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:171","lib/client.js:321","lib/client.js:600","lib/client.js:671","lib/client.js:833","lib/index.js:4"]}
{"unit_id":"nico-zhuang__dsh-nav-fold#card-en","repo":"nico-zhuang/dsh-nav-fold","commit":"35f94bec830f4a3ebe47d19583715fb59d67cdd6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-nav-fold collapses and reorders DSH sidebar icons. Optional workspace, activity, and favorites views organize sessions with open, pin, archive, and copy-ID actions. A shortcut enables keyboard navigation; a setting hides the macOS brand row. Unknown layouts use the native workspace.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:171","lib/client.js:321","lib/client.js:600","lib/client.js:671","lib/client.js:833","lib/index.js:4"]}
